<p><a href="/autopilot/net-contribution">← Back to Sales after costs</a></p><h1>Review actual order costs</h1><p><%= preview.snapshot.length %> order rows · <%= preview.status==='APPLIED'?'Applied to the contribution report':preview.status==='STOPPED'?'Stopped without importing costs':'Awaiting your review' %>. Compare these amounts with the original statements or receipts. Positive amounts are net costs; negative amounts are net provider credits. These facts affect this report and do not post money or accounting entries.</p>
<div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>Order</th><th>Customer</th><th>Channel</th><th>Net fees</th><th>Net shipping incl returns</th><th>Original source</th></tr></thead><tbody><% preview.snapshot.forEach(r=>{ %><tr><td><%= r.orderNumber %></td><td><%= r.customer %></td><td><%= r.channel %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.feesMinor,r.currency) %></td><td><%= helpers.money(r.shippingMinor,r.currency) %></td><td><%= r.sourceReference %></td></tr><% }) %></tbody></table></div>
<% if(preview.status==='DRAFT'){ %><% if(!allowed){ %><p class="notice"><strong>Growth / Pro / Custom</strong> is required to confirm new reported costs. <a class="btn" href="/billing">Upgrade</a></p><% } %><form method="post" action="/autopilot/net-contribution/reviews/<%= preview.id %>/apply" class="form-stack"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input required type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes" <%= allowed?'':'disabled' %>> I checked the net fees and shipping costs, including returns and confirmed refunds, against their original sources.</label><button class="btn btn--primary" <%= allowed?'':'disabled' %>>Confirm these reported costs</button></form><form method="post" action="/autopilot/net-contribution/reviews/<%= preview.id %>/stop"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrfToken %>"><label><input required type="checkbox" name="confirmed" value="yes"> Stop this unreviewed cost import.</label><button class="btn">Stop cost review</button></form><% }else{ %><p><a class="btn btn--primary" href="/autopilot/net-contribution">Open the contribution report</a></p><% } %>
